    "coverLetter": "Dear Casa Paco Team,\n\nI am writing to introduce myself for future front-of-house opportunities at Casa Paco. My experience at Capra’s includes Bar Lead, Server, Private Event Server and Private Event Coordinator roles. I bring a calm, organized service style built on clear communication, dependable handoffs and attention to a guest’s pace.\n\nCasa Paco appeals to me because its hospitality is deliberately personal. The current formats ask the floor to guide guests through a blind seafood-focused Chef’s Menu, a distinct Bar Room experience and Paella Sunday, while the wine programme gives people an informed path from Fino to bottles from Spain and Italy. I would study the live menu and cellar carefully, confirm details rather than guess, and help each guest understand the experience they have reserved.\n\nMy Bar Lead experience would support thoughtful beverage service, and my private-event background would be relevant to communicating clearly with hosts and groups in a room that also offers private dining. I am interested in earning more leadership responsibility through product knowledge, reliability and teamwork. If the team is open to future consideration, I would appreciate the appropriate contact or process.\n\nThank you for your time.\n\nSincerely,\nJonathan Beaulne",
