    "coverLetter": "Dear Soos Team,\n\nI am writing to introduce myself for future front-of-house opportunities. My work at Capra’s has included Bar Lead and Server responsibilities, along with Private Event Coordinator and Private Event Server roles. Those positions have taught me to keep service organized, communicate clearly with a team, and stay present with guests while timing and needs are changing.\n\nSoos appeals to me because the menu and bar program ask for real guest guidance. The Malaysian dishes have their own sambal, curry, wok and braise language, while the cocktail list gives the bar a distinct point of view. I would bring a calm, guest-first approach to service and put in the work to learn the team’s current food, spice and beverage standards accurately.\n\nI am also interested in the restaurant’s private dining and buyout work. My event background has made me attentive to preparation, handoffs and thoughtful communication when a group’s plan changes. I would be glad to contribute that mindset wherever the team needs it. Over time, I hope to earn broader leadership responsibility through reliable daily service and deeper product knowledge.\n\nIf there is a suitable time to meet about future needs, I would appreciate the opportunity to introduce myself.\n\nSincerely,\nJonathan Beaulne",
