      "food": "Côte de Boeuf’s official site describes French classics and daily changing chalkboard menus; its currently linked PDF gives the concrete published menu: escargots C$17, terrine C$19, tartare C$27, foie gras C$32, steak frites C$49, ribeye C$74 and côte de boeuf C$172, plus desserts in the C$12–14 range. Tartare plus steak frites is C$76 before tax, and the PDF says HST is excluded. Its URL path is dated October 2025, so this supports research and a transparent basket, never a same-day guarantee. The official site’s in-house butchery, terrines and foie gras add reliable context to the food identity.",
