      "claimToFame": "Its distinct combination is real and specific: locally sourced beef butchered in-house by handsaw, house terrines and foie gras, walk-in bar à vin service, a reservation-only Butcher’s Table and private dining inside the shop. This is not a generic steakhouse pitch. It gives Jonathan several valid discussion points without relying on unverified awards, exaggerated provenance or a static menu.",
